OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'feared for life' after
OL,4,Arival fan fell from stand
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has told a jury she thought she
OL,7,F"could have died" when a football fan
OL,8,Ffell on to her from the upper tier of a
OL,9,Fgrandstand during a match.
OL,11,FJoanne Peters, who has the back
OL,12,Fcondition scoliosis, was injured when
OL,13,F62-year-old John Ryan landed on her at
OL,14,FIpswich Town's Portman Road ground in
OL,15,FJanuary 2024.
OL,17,FIpswich Crown Court heard how Peters
OL,18,Finitially thought the box behind her
OL,19,Fhad collapsed and she had been left
OL,20,F"terrified" by the impact.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
