OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'feared for life' after
OL,4,Arival fan fell from stand
OL,5,
OL,6,FRyan, of Railway Street, Chatham, Kent,
OL,7,Fdenies one count of assault by beating
OL,8,Fand one count of actual bodily harm.
OL,9,FThe jury has retired to consider its
OL,10,Fverdicts.
